00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:03,059
(Transcribed by TurboScribe. Go Unlimited to remove this message.) Pat and Angel are twins.

2
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:05,720
They like different things though.

3
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:08,560
Pat likes salty food.

4
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:11,280
Angel likes sweet food.

5
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:15,760
Pat likes chips, pizza, and burgers.

6
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:21,420
Angel likes cake, ice cream, and strawberries.

7
00:00:22,620 --> 00:00:25,280
Their parents wanted to buy them a meal

8
00:00:25,280 --> 00:00:26,340
for their birthday.

9
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:30,960
The problem was that they wanted different things.

10
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:34,380
Pat wanted to eat salty fish.

11
00:00:35,680 --> 00:00:37,460
Angel wanted to eat cake.

12
00:00:38,440 --> 00:00:40,700
Why can't we get both things?

13
00:00:41,080 --> 00:00:41,840
Pat asked.

14
00:00:42,540 --> 00:00:46,220
We are having money problems, her mom said.

15
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:49,780
Let's get the fish, Angel said.

16
00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:53,460
Her parents were impressed by her maturity.

17
00:00:54,420 --> 00:00:55,740
Pat thanked her twin.
